  'bank.dismantleHint': ['选中斧头或电锯，长按 1.5 秒，掉落一个可重新放置的小猪存钱罐。松开即取消。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold for 1.5 s to recover a piggy bank you can place again. Release to cancel.'],
