  'touch.transferOff': ['点随身物品查看说明，使用说明卡按钮转移；点容器物品收入背包。整理模式可指定格子。', 'Tap carried items to inspect; use the guide button to transfer. Tap container items to take them. Arrange mode chooses destination slots.'],
  'touch.transferPick': ['先点物品，再点目标空格；木材也可点入篝火燃料区。', 'Tap an item, then an empty destination slot. Tap the fire fuel area to deposit selected wood.'],
  'touch.transferSelected': ['已选：{item}。点目标空格转移，再点选中物品取消。', 'Selected: {item}. Tap an empty slot to move; tap the selection again to cancel.'],
  'touch.helpTitle': ['手机操作 · 横竖屏均可', 'Touch controls · portrait or landscape'],
  'touch.help': ['左摇杆移动，右摇杆或点按场景瞄准，松开右摇杆保留方向。点“使用”攻击、吃东西或打开箱子/篝火；步枪连发、吃东西和砍树需要按住。拆箱子或篝火须打开窗口、取空物品（篝火含储备木材与火种），手持斧头长按窗内拆除按钮 1.5 秒；回收的篝火为熄灭状态。选建筑后点“放置”。“丢弃”按瞄准方向扔出手持物品。物品栏可左右滑动；打开背包点“整理物品”，先点物品、再点目标空格，在背包、物品栏和容器之间转移。横屏、竖屏或锁定转屏都能游玩，无需全屏。', 'Move with the left stick. Aim with the right stick or tap the world; releasing the right stick keeps your aim. Tap Use to attack, eat or open containers. Hold for rifle fire, eating or chopping. To dismantle a chest or campfire, open it and remove all items (including stored wood and the igniter), equip an axe and hold its panel button for 1.5 s. Recovered campfires are unlit. Equip a building and tap Build. Drop throws the equipped item toward your aim. Swipe the hotbar to reach all slots. In the bag, enable Arrange, tap an item, then an empty bag, hotbar or container slot. Portrait, landscape and rotation-locked screens work without fullscreen.'],
