  'downed.description': ['怪物不会索敌或攻击倒地的你，游荡也不受你吸引。可使用急救包，或制作、放置并点燃篝火，取暖至 5°C 后站起。', 'Monsters ignore you while downed, including attacks and wander bias. Use a first aid kit, or craft, place and light a campfire. Warm up to stand again at 5°C.'],
