  'panel.inventoryDescription': ['点击物品查看作用和用法；双击、拖动或点说明卡按钮，在独立的30格背包与10格物品栏之间转移。', 'Select an item to see its effect and use. Double-click, drag or use its guide button to transfer between the separate 30-slot backpack and 10-slot hotbar.'],
  'panel.containerDescription': ['背包、物品栏与容器可互相拖动。点击容器物品取到背包，Shift 点击随身物品快速存入。', 'Drag items between the backpack, hotbar and container. Click container items to take them into the backpack; Shift-click carried items to store them.'],
  'panel.chestSlots': ['{count} / {capacity} 格 · 物品不堆叠', '{count} / {capacity} slots · Items do not stack'],
  'chest.dismantle': ['长按拆除空箱子 · 1.5 秒', 'Hold to dismantle empty chest · 1.5 s'],
  'chest.dismantling': ['正在拆除 · {percent}%', 'Dismantling · {percent}%'],
  'chest.dismantleHint': ['选中斧头或电锯，持续按住 1.5 秒，掉落 1 个箱子，可再次放置。松开即取消；失温倒地或怪物正在拆除时不可用。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold for 1.5 s to recover one chest that can be placed again. Release to cancel. Unavailable while downed or a monster is dismantling it.'],
  'chest.emptyFirst': ['请先取出箱子中的全部物品，才能长按拆除。', 'Remove every item from the chest before holding to dismantle it.'],
  'vending.dismantle': ['长按拆除自动售货机 · 1.5 秒', 'Hold to dismantle vending machine · 1.5 s'],
  'vending.dismantleHint': ['选中斧头或电锯，持续按住 1.5 秒。松开即取消，成功后掉落一台可重新放置的自动售货机。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold for 1.5 s. Release to cancel. Dismantling drops a vending machine you can place again.'],
  'match.dismantle': ['长按拆除自助火柴机 · 1.5 秒', 'Hold to dismantle match dispenser · 1.5 s'],
  'match.dismantleHint': ['选中斧头或电锯，持续按住 1.5 秒。松开即取消，成功后掉落一台可重新放置的自助火柴机。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold for 1.5 s. Release to cancel. Dismantling drops a match dispenser you can place again.'],
