  'gun.dismantleHint': ['选中斧头或电锯，持续按住 1.5 秒。松开即取消，成功后掉落一台可重新放置的自动枪械机。', 'Equip an axe or chainsaw or chainsaw and hold for 1.5 s. Release to cancel. Drops a weapon dispenser you can place again.'],
