  'item.return_staff': ['回城法杖', 'Return staff'],
  'hint.returnStaff': ['长按使用 {duration} 秒返回原点附近 · 剩余 {uses} 次', 'Hold use for {duration} s to return near the origin · {uses} uses left'],
  'help.returnTitle': ['带上归途', 'A way home'],
  'help.return': ['自然房屋箱子独立有 2% 概率生成回城法杖。装备后长按左键 1.5 秒（手机长按使用键），传送到离原点最近的空地格中心；同距时，优先离最近怪物格子更远的位置。初始 20 次，每次消耗 1 次，用尽消失。松开、切换物品或打开界面会取消施法，不扣次数；失温倒地也能使用，但不会恢复体温或饥饿。', 'Natural house chests independently have a 2% chance to contain a return staff. Equip it and hold left click for 1.5 s (hold Use on mobile) to teleport to the empty tile center nearest the origin; ties favor the tile farthest from the nearest monster tile. It starts with 20 uses, spends one per cast and disappears when exhausted. Releasing, switching items or opening a panel cancels without spending a use. Downed players can use it, but it does not restore warmth or hunger.'],
  'storage.hotbarFull': ['物品栏已满，请先腾出空格。', 'Hotbar full. Free up a slot first.'],
  'storage.backpackFull': ['背包已满，请先腾出空格。', 'Backpack full. Free up a slot first.'],
  'storage.chestFull': ['箱子已满。', 'Chest full.'],
